    {"attr": "product", "op": "eq", "value": "mobile"},
    {"attr": "prior_tickets_30d", "op": "gte", "value": 2}
  ],
  "beats": ["R0001"],
  "loses_to": [],
  "note": "Free tier users with mobile product and at least 2 prior tickets, severity 3 or lower, need technical support. This generalizes the existing free-tier mobile rules (R0005, R0008) to cover severity 3 and any product, but since the ticket is mobile, it fits a mobile-specific rule. It beats R0001 (enterprise general) because the free tier is more specific for this case."
}

